{#
  BeMart admin News edit — EC-CUBE goNews (新着情報登録/編集).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Content/news_edit.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Content/news_edit.twig).

  This is the admin pilot's FORM/CRUD page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`), not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The
  markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim
  from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic bindings are rebound.

  FORM-PAGE recipe (Ray.WebFormModule — see var/templates/README.md):
  the News resource (src/Resource/Page/Admin/News/News.php) exposes an
  {@see \MyVendor\BeMart\Form\AdminNewsForm} as `body['form']`, pre-filled
  with the persisted row. The inputs render through that real form
  object:

    {{ form.input('title')|raw }}       <- real <input> w/ id/attrs/value
    {{ form.error('title') }}           <- inline Be-domain error, if any

  EC-CUBE renders the same inputs through the Symfony FormView
  (`form_widget(form.title)`); Ray.WebFormModule is BeMart's
  BEAR-idiomatic equivalent. `AdminNewsForm::init()` ports the field
  names / ids / attributes from EC-CUBE's `NewsType` (block prefix
  `/admin/news/news`) so the rendered markup carries EC-CUBE's form shape.

  VALIDATION AUTHORITY STAYS WITH the Be Framework Becoming chain — the
  form is a field-definition + renderer. On a domain rejection the News
  resource repopulates `form` and exposes `body.message`.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `canonical-url route)`         -> deterministic `/{route}` (BeMartTwigExtension).
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     hidden `_token` input is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `form_widget(form.visible)` (公開 / 非公開 display-status select)
     -> NOT carried by the AdminNewsFetched projection (EC-CUBE's
     dtb_news.visible was out of the Wave 9 CMS slice). The conversion-
     area visible select is OMITTED, not invented. Enumerated as residual.
   - `{% form_theme %}` and the `auto_render` entity-extension loop ->
     Symfony form-theme / EC-CUBE entity-extension runtime. No BeMart
     equivalent; dropped. EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin-news-news' %}
{% set title = '新着情報管理' %}
{% set sub_title = 'コンテンツ管理' %}

{% block main %}
    <form role="form" class="form-horizontal" name="form1" id="form1" method="post" action="{% if newsId is defined and newsId %}/admin/news/news?newsId={{ newsId }}&_method=put{% else %}/admin/news/news-list{% endif %}">
        <input type="hidden" id="news__token" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default('') }}">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
            <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
                <div class="c-primaryCol">
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8">
                                    <span class="card-title">新着情報登録</span></div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#newsForm"
                                                                 aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="newsForm"><i class="fa fa-lg fa-angle-up"></i></a></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ec-cardCollapse collapse show" id="newsForm" style="">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>公開日時</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">
                                                必須
                                        </span>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col mb-2">
                                        {{ form.input('publishDate')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('publishDate') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('publishDate') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>タイトル</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">
                                                必須
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col mb-2">
                                        {{ form.input('newsTitle')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('newsTitle') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('newsTitle') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="リンク先のURLを入力してください。">
                                            <span>URL</span><i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col mb-2">
                                        {{ form.input('newsUrl')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('newsUrl') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('newsUrl') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-3">&nbsp;</div>
                                    <div class="col mb-2">
                                        <input type="hidden" name="linkMethod" value="0">
                                        <label for="admin_news_link_method"><input id="admin_news_link_method" type="checkbox" name="linkMethod" value="1"{% if linkMethod|default(false) %} checked{% endif %}> 別ウィンドウで開く</label>
                                        {% if form.error('linkMethod') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('linkMethod') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="本文を入力してください。">
                                            <span>本文</span><i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col mb-2">
                                        {{ form.input('newsDescription')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('newsDescription') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('newsDescription') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="c-conversionArea">
                    <div class="c-conversionArea__container">
                        <div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <div class="c-conversionArea__leftBlockItem">
                                    <a class="c-baseLink" href="/admin/news/news-list">
                                        <i class="fa fa-backward" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        <span>新着情報管理</span></a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <div id="ex-conversion-action" class="row align-items-center justify-content-end">
                                    <div class="col-auto">
                                        <button class="btn btn-ec-conversion px-5" type="submit">登録</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>

    {% if message is defined and message %}
        <p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ message }}</p>
    {% endif %}
{% endblock %}
